# Colossus of the Strait - the island's own part of its test (the plan test includes this one; colossus_of_the_strait.play
# fetches the three gears from the earlier islands first, then includes it).
island Colossus of the Strait
offset 0 0
expect title The Giant's Heart
walk -66 0 to -52 0 h=5
zone west_headland
read Syndicate camp orders
zone syndicate_camp
kill Hyena
expect step 3
open Syndicate strongbox
expect story raft-Tangaroa_KeyCard 1
walk -36 -4 to -30 0 to -28 0 h=5
zone heel_door
use heeldoor
expect hidden heeldoor
expect step 6
walk -27 0 to -23 0 h=5
use lift
wait 6
expect story heelride 1
expect height 18.3
zone chest_chamber
read Builders' inscription
kill Mama bear
expect step 10
use gearwheel
expect story gear1 0
expect story gear3 0
expect shown eyes
expect shown headladder
use headladder
expect height 22.4
zone head
open Crown vault
expect story kettshat 1
expect item TitaniumIngot 3
read Kett's note
expect done
